            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal />
                <mainWalls>RENOVATING GARAGE FOR A LIVING SPACE



- Actual walls 2X6 @ 16, R-20

- Upgrade to R-40 (Existing 2x6 R-20 + 2X6 R-20) L= 97.6'

- The garage door wall must be built the same way as the rest of the exterior walls. 

- Make sure that the envelope of the building is continous and sealed 

- This renovation will change the heated volume of the house by adding a volume space of: 5357 cubic foot

- Verify the roof to make sure that the R-VALUE is smilar as the rest of the house (R-60)



REBATES:

 R-20 +: 2.50$/ square foot

 R-30 +: 3.50$/square foot</mainWalls>
                <ceilings>ATTIC ABOVE GARAGE SPACE



- Make sure insulation above garage min. R-60. </ceilings>
                <AdditionalComments />
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
